@startuml CQRS事务一致性时序图

actor User as "用户"
participant "API层" as API
participant "应用服务\n(OrderService)" as AppService
participant "数据库\n(主库)" as Database
participant "Outbox表" as Outbox
participant "事件发布者\n(后台进程)" as Publisher
participant "消息队列\n(Kafka)" as Kafka
participant "读模型数据库\n(从库)" as ReadDB

== 命令侧（写模型） ==
User -> API: 提交创建订单请求
API -> AppService: CreateOrder(cmd)
group 数据库事务
    AppService -> Database: 开启事务
    AppService -> Database: INSERT订单数据
    AppService -> Outbox: INSERT事件记录
    AppService -> Database: 提交事务
end
API -> User: 返回操作成功

== 事件侧（最终一致性） ==
loop 后台轮询
    Publisher -> Outbox: 查询未发布事件
    Outbox --> Publisher: 返回事件列表
    Publisher -> Kafka: Publish(event)
    alt 发布成功
        Publisher -> Outbox: 标记事件为已发布
        Kafka -> ReadDB: 更新读模型
    else 发布失败
        Publisher -> Publisher: 等待重试
    end
end

@enduml